PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{
  "product_category_id": "{{catElk.response.body.$.data[0].id}}",
  "sku": "HP-001",
  "name": "Smartphone 6 inch",
  "unit": "pcs"
}

### Create produk gagal: staff — harapan 403 "anda tidak memiliki akses: products:create"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStaffMalang.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

