# =====================================================================
# Outbounds — /api/v1/outbounds (barang keluar ke customer)
# Staff: create, read, revisi (hanya pembuatnya). Supervisor: read, approve, reject.
# Superadmin: semua. Data dibatasi gudang milik user (WarehouseScope).
# Status: pending -> approved (stok berkurang) | rejected -> revisi -> pending lagi.
# Rak asal wajib diisi per item; quantity selalu positif dan selalu mengurangi stok.
# Stok HANYA berubah saat approve; stok tidak cukup = 422 dan semua item rollback.
# Memakai stok WH-MALANG-01 hasil section Stock adjustments (LP-001@RAK-A-01,
# TB-001@RAK-A-02); prasyaratnya sama dengan section Inbounds.
# Alur bisa diulang (nomor OUT baru tiap create) selama stoknya masih cukup.
# =====================================================================

# ---- Alur A: kirim barang -> revisi -> approve ----

### Create out-bound (staff Malang) — harapan 201, status pending, reference_number OUT-YYYYMM-NNNN
# @name createOutbound
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/outbounds
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStaffMalang.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{
  "warehouse_id": "{{whMalang.response.body.$.data[0].id}}",
  "notes": "Pengiriman ke Toko Sinar Jaya Malang",
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": "{{productLp001.response.body.$.data[0].id}}",
      "warehouse_location_id": "{{locMalang.response.body.$.data[0].id}}",
      "quantity": 5,
      "notes": "Order SO-1001"
    },
    {
      "product_id": "{{productTb001.response.body.$.data[0].id}}",
      "warehouse_location_id": "{{locMalang.response.body.$.data[1].id}}",
      "quantity": 3
    }
  ]
}

### List out-bound staff Malang — harapan 200, hanya pengajuan WH-MALANG-01, terbaru dulu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/outbounds?page=1&per_page=15
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStaffMalang.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

