GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/outbounds?warehouse_id={{whMalang.response.body.$.data[0].id}}&status=pending
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSupervisor.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### List out-bound dengan search — cocokkan reference_number (ILIKE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/outbounds?search={{createOutbound.response.body.$.data.reference_number}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSupervisor.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Get out-bound by id — harapan 200, items berisi product & warehouse_location
