### Approve (supervisor) — harapan 200, status approved; stok LP-001@RAK-A-01 -4, TB-001@RAK-A-02 -3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/outbounds/{{createOutbound.response.body.$.data.id}}/approve
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSupervisor.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

